      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "用扣血降费、终结增血或双倍费用双次发动等条件改造技能",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "A skill may reduce HP upon use but lower its cost. A skill could increase your max HP permanently if it lands the finishing blow. A skill’s cost may double, but it activates twice in succession.",
